---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="EnerGo — Ali Zhetpis" homeHref="/" workHref="/#work" footer={false}>
  <main class="cs-main">

    <!-- ── Page 1+2: Hero + Logo ── -->
    <section class="cs-page">
      <div style="display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:80px; width:100%;">
        <div class="cs-row">
          <div class="cs-col-left">
            <a href="/" class="cs-back">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M12 4L12 20M12 4L6 10M12 4L18 10" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
              Back
            </a>
          </div>
          <div class="cs-col-right">
            <img src="/assets/energo/icon.svg" alt="EnerGo icon" class="cs-icon" />
            <div style="display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:8px;">
              <p class="cs-heading">EnerGo</p>
              <p class="cs-desc">A 0→1 charging app for a market where EVs arrived before good software did. Researched, designed, written, and shipped in 3 months</p>
            </div>
            <div class="cs-meta">
              <div class="cs-meta-row">
                <span class="cs-meta-label">Period</span>
                <span class="cs-meta-value">2025 · 3 months</span>
              </div>
              <div class="cs-meta-row">
                <span class="cs-meta-label">Role</span>
                <span class="cs-meta-value">Lead Product Designer</span>
              </div>
              <div class="cs-meta-row">
                <span class="cs-meta-label">Scope</span>
                <span class="cs-meta-value">Research, UI/UX, UX Writing, CJM, Design System, Prototyping</span>
              </div>
              <div class="cs-meta-row">
                <span class="cs-meta-label">Platform</span>
                <span class="cs-meta-value">iOS &amp; Android</span>
              </div>
              <div class="cs-meta-row">
                <span class="cs-meta-label">Link</span>
                <span class="cs-meta-value"><a href="https://energocharge.uz" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="link-hover">energocharge.uz</a></span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="cs-logo-hero">
          <img src="/assets/energo/icon.svg" class="cs-logo-icon" alt="" />
          <span class="cs-logo-text">EnerGo</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ── Page 3: The Challenge ── -->
    <section class="cs-page">
      <div class="cs-row">
        <div class="cs-col-left">
          <p class="cs-section-heading">The Challenge</p>
        </div>
        <div class="cs-col-right cs-body">
          <p>Uzbekistan's EV boom outpaced its apps. Charging apps existed, but they were rough: no onboarding, hidden payments, stations shown "free" that weren't.</p>
          <p>EnerGo is the software layer for a network building toward 3,000 stations across the country. My job: make charging feel effortless. From zero. In three months.</p>
          <p>The constraints that shaped everything</p>
          <ul>
            <li>3 months from kickoff to release</li>
            <li>A lean dev team</li>
            <li>An unfamiliar market</li>
            <li>Hardware constraints</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ── Pages 4–7: Research (combined) ── -->
    <section class="cs-page">
      <div style="display:flex; flex-direction:column; width:100%;">
        <div class="cs-row">
          <div class="cs-col-left" style="position:sticky; top:90px;">
            <p class="cs-section-heading">The Research</p>
          </div>
          <div class="cs-col-right cs-body">
            <div style="display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:60px;">
              <div style="display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:20px;">
                <p>None of us drove an EV, so we visited charging stations to see how they work: connector types, how a session starts, what the app-to-station sequence actually looks like.</p>
                <p>Two things came out of it: connector selection needed to be explicit in the flow, and a short usage instruction had to live inside the charging screen.</p>
              </div>
              <div style="display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:20px;">
                <p class="cs-subheading">Deep interviews</p>
                <p>6 respondents in Tashkent, 5 of them electric taxi drivers: up to 8,000 km a month, charging once or twice a day. The most demanding segment on the market.</p>
                <ul>
                  <li>Availability beats everything. The top complaint: driving to a "free" station and finding it blocked.</li>
                  <li>Booking is a hidden gem. Most didn't know it could exist. Those who tried it never went back.</li>
                  <li>Map people vs list people. The room split 50/50. Both views had to be first-class.</li>
                  <li>Trust in payments is fragile. One driver deleted an app after a station died at 66% with his money loaded.</li>
                  <li>Drivers know every price by heart. Transparency decides loyalty.</li>
                </ul>
              </div>
              <div class="cs-collage">
                <img src="/assets/energo/slice5.png" alt="" style="width:748px; height:312px; top:-48px; left:-105px; transform:rotate(-15deg); transform-origin:center;" />
                <img src="/assets/energo/slice6.png" alt="" style="width:748px; height:312px; top:38px; left:342px; transform:rotate(15.46deg); transform-origin:center;" />
                <img src="/assets/energo/slice4.png" alt="" style="width:748px; height:156px; top:594px; left:277px; transform:rotate(-4.55deg); transform-origin:center;" />
                <img src="/assets/energo/slice1.png" alt="" style="width:748px; height:487px; top:50%; left:50%; transform:translate(-50%,-50%);" />
              </div>
              <div style="display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:20px;">
                <p class="cs-subheading">Competitive teardown</p>
                <p>8 apps across Uzbekistan and Kazakhstan, 90+ annotated flows, benchmarked across 20+ criteria.</p>
                <ul>
                  <li>Half had no onboarding. One had no list, no search, no profile.</li>
                  <li>Only 1 of 8 let you filter to free connectors.</li>
                  <li>Only 3 of 8 had booking.</li>
                  <li>Minimum top-ups ranged from 1,000 to 19,999 soum, for no reason.</li>
                  <li>Some stacked a password and a PIN on top of SMS codes.</li>
                </ul>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ── Pages 8–15: From Insight to Interface (all screens) ── -->
    <section class="cs-page">
      <div style="display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:0; width:100%;">
        <div class="cs-row" style="align-items:flex-start;">
          <div class="cs-col-left" style="position:sticky; top:90px;">
            <p class="cs-section-heading">From Insight to Interface</p>
          </div>
          <div class="cs-col-right" style="gap:40px;">
            <div class="cs-phone-box">
              <div style="position:absolute; top:50%; left:50%; transform:translate(-50%, -50%); width:185px; height:400px; overflow:hidden;">
                <video src="/assets/energo/screen1_cropped.mp4" autoplay loop muted playsinline style="position:absolute; top:50%; left:50%; width:240px; height:520px; transform:translate(-50%, -50%); object-fit:cover; pointer-events:none;"></video>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="cs-phone-box"><img src="/assets/energo/screen2.png" alt="" /></div>
            <div class="cs-phone-box"><img src="/assets/energo/screen3.png" alt="" /></div>
            <div class="cs-phone-box"><img src="/assets/energo/screen4.png" alt="" /></div>
            <div class="cs-phone-box"><img src="/assets/energo/screen5.png" alt="" /></div>
            <div class="cs-phone-box"><img src="/assets/energo/screen6.png" alt="" /></div>
            <div class="cs-phone-box"><img src="/assets/energo/screen7.png" alt="" /></div>
            <div class="cs-phone-box"><img src="/assets/energo/screen8.png" alt="" /></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

  </main>

  <Fragment slot="scripts">
    <script is:inline>
      // ── Section entrance: items fade up as they scroll into view ─
      function getAnimItems(section) {
        const items = [], seen = new Set();
        function add(el) { if (el && !seen.has(el)) { seen.add(el); items.push(el); } }

        section.querySelectorAll('.cs-row').forEach(row => {
          Array.from(row.children).forEach(child => {
            if (child.classList.contains('cs-col-left')) {
              if (child.childElementCount > 0) add(child);
            } else if (child.classList.contains('cs-col-right')) {
              Array.from(child.children).forEach(add);
            } else {
              add(child);
            }
          });
        });

        section.querySelectorAll('.cs-logo-hero').forEach(el => {
          if (!el.closest('.cs-row')) add(el);
        });

        return items;
      }

      const animItems = [];
      [...document.querySelectorAll('.cs-page')].slice(1).forEach(section => {
        animItems.push(...getAnimItems(section));
      });

      observeReveal(animItems, { threshold: 0.15, rootMargin: '0px 0px -60px 0px' });
    </script>
  </Fragment>
</Layout>

<style>
  /* These two override shared elements rendered by Layout/Header, not
     anything in this page's own template — Astro's automatic style
     scoping can't reach them, so they're marked :global() deliberately. */
  :global(body) {
    user-select: text; -webkit-user-select: text;
  }
  :global(.header) {
    position: fixed;
    left: 0; right: 0;
    max-width: var(--max-w);
    margin-left: auto;
    margin-right: auto;
    will-change: auto;
  }

  .cs-main { display: block; }

  .cs-page {
    min-height: 100vh;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    padding: 140px var(--pad) 100px;
    box-sizing: border-box;
  }

  .cs-page > * { width: 100%; }

  .cs-logo-hero {
    height: 600px;
    width: 100%;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 24px;
    background: var(--item-bg);
  }
  .cs-logo-icon { width: 80px; height: 80px; flex-shrink: 0; }
  .cs-logo-text {
    font-size: 80px;
    line-height: 1;
    color: var(--energo-green);
    font-weight: 700;
  }
  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .cs-logo-icon { width: 48px; height: 48px; }
    .cs-logo-text { font-size: 48px; }
  }

  .cs-row {
    display: flex;
    gap: var(--gap);
    align-items: flex-start;
  }

  .cs-col-left {
    width: var(--col-left);
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .cs-col-right {
    flex: 1;
    min-width: 0;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 20px;
  }

  .cs-back {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    font-size: 18px;
    line-height: 1.6;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--dark);
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: opacity .2s;
  }

  .cs-back:hover { opacity: 0.55; }

  .cs-back svg { width: 24px; height: 24px; flex-shrink: 0; transform: rotate(-90deg); }

  .cs-icon { width: 60px; height: 60px; object-fit: contain; display: block; }

  .cs-heading { font-size: 32px; line-height: 1.2; color: var(--dark); }
  .cs-subheading { font-size: 28px; line-height: 1.2; color: var(--dark); }
  .cs-desc { font-size: 24px; line-height: 1.2; color: var(--muted); }
  .cs-body { font-size: 24px; line-height: 1.2; color: var(--dark); }
  .cs-section-heading { font-size: 32px; line-height: 1.2; color: var(--dark); }

  .cs-body p, .cs-body ul, .cs-body .cs-subheading { max-width: 80%; }

  .cs-body ul {
    list-style: disc;
    padding-left: 36px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0;
  }
  .cs-body ul li { line-height: 1.2; }

  .cs-meta {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0;
    max-width: 670px;
  }

  .cs-meta-row {
    display: flex;
    gap: 20px;
    font-size: 18px;
    line-height: 1.2;
    align-items: flex-start;
    padding: 16px 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--divider);
  }
  .cs-meta-row:last-child { border-bottom: none; }

  .cs-meta-label {
    width: 95px;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    color: var(--muted);
  }

  .cs-meta-value {
    color: var(--dark);
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    display: flex;
    gap: 4px 12px;
  }

  .cs-collage {
    background: var(--item-bg);
    width: 100%;
    height: 600px;
    overflow: hidden;
    position: relative;
  }

  .cs-collage img {
    position: absolute;
    object-fit: cover;
    box-shadow: 0 0 10px 4px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
  }

  .cs-phone-box {
    flex: none;
    width: 100%;
    height: 600px;
    background: var(--item-bg);
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .cs-phone-box img {
    position: absolute;
    top: 50%;
    left: 50%;
    transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
    height: 400px;
    width: 185px;
    object-fit: contain;
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  .cs-phone-box video {
    position: absolute;
    top: 50%;
    left: 50%;
    transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
    height: 400px;
    width: 185px;
    object-fit: contain;
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .cs-page { padding: 72px 20px 24px; }
    .cs-row { flex-direction: column; gap: 24px; }
    .cs-col-left { width: 100%; }
    .cs-heading { font-size: 24px; }
    .cs-subheading { font-size: 20px; }
    .cs-desc, .cs-body { font-size: 18px; }
    .cs-section-heading { font-size: 24px; }
    .cs-collage { height: calc(100vh - 120px); }
    .cs-phone-box { height: 480px; }
    .cs-phone-box img { height: 300px; width: auto; }
  }
</style>
